[2026-01-30T15:29:32.010Z] [STDOUT] {"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-5-20251101","id":"msg_01QqucXm3mCiaKDfAr6gvLj1","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Implementation complete. Here's a summary:\n\n**Created `src/components/report/core/FocusContext.tsx`:**\n- `FocusProvider` - Context provider that manages focus state with history\n- `useFocus()` - Hook for components that need full focus control\n- `useFocusSafe()` - Safe hook that returns null if not in provider\n- `useFocusState(type, id)` - Returns 'focused' | 'related' | null for styling\n\n**Features:**\n- **Global focus tracking** - Single source of truth for what item is focused (finding, source, entity, etc.)\n- **Focus history** - Up to 20 items stored for back navigation with `goBack()`\n- **Cross-view highlighting** - When a finding is focused, related sources are highlighted via `isRelated()` check\n- **Convenience methods** - `focusFinding()`, `focusSource()`, `focusEntity()` with related items\n\n**Updated views:**\n- `FindingsView` - Now updates global focus when a finding is expanded, and highlights rows when they're related to a focused source\n- `SourcesView` - Updates global focus on source selection with related finding IDs, highlights cards when related to a focused finding  \n- `EntitiesView` - Updates global focus on entity selection\n\nThe focus system transforms disconnected views into a coordinated investigation interface where selecting an item in one view highlights related items in other views."}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":1,"cache_creation_input_tokens":251,"cache_read_input_tokens":95028,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":251},"output_tokens":1,"service_tier":"standard"},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"063d9692-0974-4418-8890-3933b0ef315a","uuid":"f63412c6-7ede-4858-98fe-1c5b1208254e"}
